<title>INDIA: India's RBI sets 3-year bond cut-off at 12.14 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI sets 3-year bond cut-off at 12.14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off of 12.14 percent at an auction of three-year government bonds on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 172 bids for 57.45 billion rupees of which it accepted 36 (four of them partial) for 30.0 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off was 12.07 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
